\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}language\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffectiveEnum}_{\\Sigma}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\Sigma}(\\{(\\beta(n),f(n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}language\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffectiveEnum}_{\\Sigma}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\Sigma}(\\{(\\beta(n),f(n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}language\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Enumerable}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L=\\varnothing\\lor\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*\\;(\\operatorname{EffectiveEnum}_{\\Sigma}(f)\\land L=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}language\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Enumerable}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L=\\varnothing\\lor\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*\\;(\\operatorname{EffectiveEnum}_{\\Sigma}(f)\\land L=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的总枚举允许重复，不要求字典序或无重复；总函数的像不可能为空，所以空语言必须单列。具体输出装置的枚举可以先转换成这种接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anc